Subject: [PATCH 02/10] [3.1.2] [M156] Improve state validation during scroll timeline
 snapshot updates

Original change's description:
> Improve state validation during scroll timeline snapshot updates
>
> Resolving style-dependent timeline range offsets during snapshot
> validation constructs an ElementResolveContext, which can synchronously
> recalculate slot assignments and run callbacks that modify animations,
> triggers, or layout tree state.
>
> Update ScrollSnapshotTimeline::UpdateSnapshotInternal to snapshot
> triggers and animations into local HeapVectors before iterating and
> re-verify membership on each step. Update Animation::OnValidateSnapshot
> to compute range offset updates on local copies and re-check timeline,
> effect, and range state before applying them, and re-check
> GetComputedStyle() in TimelineOffset::ResolveLength after constructing
> ElementResolveContext.
>
